{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p000299","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p000299"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p000299","label":"史厭","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"史厭","mention_ids":["c-shiji-004-zhou:m076-0027"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m076-0027","chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p076","quote":"史厭"}],"identity_note":"依本卷特定時代與敘事建立；同名與世襲官號不得全庫合併，本名未見不補造。","review":"ai_provisional"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m076-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"史厭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000299","status":"source_identified","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p076","chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p076","text":"秦借道兩周之閒，將以伐韓，周恐借之畏於韓，不借畏於秦。史厭謂周君曰：「何不令人謂韓公叔曰『秦之敢絕周而伐韓者，信東周也。公何不與周地，發質使之楚』？秦必疑楚不信周，是韓不伐也。又謂秦曰『韓彊與周地，將以疑周於秦也，周不敢不受』。秦必無辭而令周不受，是受地於韓而聽於秦。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m076-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"史厭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000299","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m076-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"周君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官號或文字疑讀；保留錨點，不補熟知姓名或假定同指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m076-0040","start":40,"end":43,"surface":"韓公叔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000300","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m076-0060","start":60,"end":61,"surface":"公","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官號或文字疑讀；保留錨點，不補熟知姓名或假定同指。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","book_id":"b-shiji-004","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-004-zhou"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-00